    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udccf <i>Booster</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open packs. Collect cards. Worship the RNG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Booster</i>, every 3 hours you get a chance to pull something awesome \u2014 or hilariously useless. Each booster contains a randomly selected card \u2014 from common critters to rare kings and legendary sharks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd55 Get boosters every 3 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Card rotation &amp; limited-time sets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Rarity system: Common, Rare, Epic, Legendary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Cards are Steam Inventory items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267b\ufe0f Trade, sell, or keep them forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 Super casual, extremely addictive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just click. Collect. And see what fate gives you.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udccf <i>Booster</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open packs. Collect cards. Worship the RNG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Booster</i>, every 3 hours you get a chance to pull something awesome \u2014 or hilariously useless. Each booster contains a randomly selected card \u2014 from common critters to rare kings and legendary sharks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd55 Get boosters every 3 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 Card rotation &amp; limited-time sets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Rarity system: Common, Rare, Epic, Legendary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Cards are Steam Inventory items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267b\ufe0f Trade, sell, or keep them forever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 Super casual, extremely addictive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just click. Collect. And see what fate gives you.</i></p>",
